# Settings of the theme

Every setting is optional. They go in `configure.yaml`, under `keywords: docs:`:

```yaml
keywords:
  docs:
    name: My project            # in the top bar
    sub: docs                   # smaller, after the name
    title: My project docs      # after the title of a page, in the browser tab
    repo_url: https://github.com/me/project
    footer: My project. Built with lhtml-site.
    menu:
      sections: [Get started, Guides, Reference]
      section:
        Reference: {open: false}
```

The full list is in the README of the theme, `themes/docs/README.md` in the package.
